@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
skinparam padding 8
skinparam dpi 180
hide footbox
autonumber
participant "advice 包" as A
participant "NavigateButton.vue" as UI
participant "地图应用或网页" as MAP
== 重算时准备工具链接 ==
A -> A : BuildAirportNav(iata, origin)
note over A : 查静态机场坐标 转为GCJ-02\n机场未收录则返回nil\nensureAirportNav 可补充工具行动
== 用户点击已有行动 ==
UI -> UI : open()\n启动1200毫秒回退计时
UI -> MAP : window.location.href = nav.app
alt 页面可见性变化
 UI -> UI : visibilitychange 回调\n清除网页回退计时
else 计时到期
 UI -> MAP : window.location.href = nav.web
end
note over UI,MAP : 仅 action.nav 非空时渲染按钮\n没有导航后端接口 不内嵌地图SDK

@enduml
